;; cljdoc article tree (https://cljdoc.org/d/io.github.unisoma/nats-cljc).
;; README and CHANGELOG would auto-discover; everything else is published only
;; because it is listed here. ADRs are deliberately NOT listed individually:
;; on the narrow sidebar each multi-line title ate ~3 lines, pushing the
;; namespace list out of scroll (and cljdoc renders nested article trees fully
;; expanded, so nesting would not have helped). Instead one entry publishes the
;; ADR index; cljdoc rewrites its relative links to GitHub blob URLs, so the
;; ADR content itself lives on GitHub only. adr-index-test guards the index
;; against drift.
{:cljdoc.doc/tree
 [["Readme"           {:file "README.md"}]
  ["Changelog"        {:file "CHANGELOG.md"}]
  ["Glossary"         {:file "CONTEXT.md"}]
  ["Design decisions" {:file "docs/adr/README.md"}]]

 ;; .cljc library — auto-detect runs both the clj and cljs analysis passes and
 ;; shows per-platform badges. Do not pin to one platform.
 :cljdoc/languages :auto-detect}
